# hextet — menuconfig 特性开关
#
# 在 feed 的顶层 Config.in 里 source 本文件（或由 scripts/feeds 自动生成）后，
# menuconfig 里 Network → VPN 下会多一个 hextet 项。
# 默认不选（default n）：hextet 需要 root + 内核 WireGuard + 公网 IPv6，属于可选功能。

config PACKAGE_hextet
	bool "hextet — IPv6-only serverless mesh VPN"
	default n
	select PACKAGE_kmod-wireguard
	help
	  hextet is an IPv6-only serverless mesh VPN.

	  Data plane is kernel WireGuard (netlink control); the daemon is managed
	  by procd + uci. This package ships the hextet binary, a procd init
	  script, uci defaults and an example hextet.toml.

	  Requirements:
	    - kernel WireGuard (kmod-wireguard)
	    - a global IPv6 address on the WAN (IPv6-only, no IPv4)
	    - IPv6 forwarding enabled when acting as a site-to-site gateway
	      (see docs/guides/site-to-site.md)
